#*: ''Inde etiam '''rosas''' effert, umbrarum[[-que#Latin|que]] frigus non ingrato sole distinguit. Finito vario illo multiplicique curvamine recto limiti redditur nec huic uni, nam viae plures intercedentibus buxis dividuntur.''<ref>[http://www.perseus.tufts.edu/hopper/text?doc=Perseus%3Atext%3A1999.02.0139%3Abook%3D5%3Aletter%3D6%3Asection%3D34 Pliny text], Latin version </ref><ref>[http://epistol.glossa.dk/plinius.html#ep5_6 Pliny text], Latin version 2</ref>
